# The Last Rose of Summer: Thomas Moore, Irish Melodies (1813), traditional air.
{title: The Last Rose of Summer}
{composer: Traditional (Irish air)}
{lyricist: Thomas Moore}
{key: G}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 3/4}
{x_level: 3}
{x_strum: D - D - D -}

{comment: Fingerstyle option: bass on 1, then the top three strings together on 2 and 3.}

